  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\00\00\00\00M`[id_this, id_market(this, data)]`. Accepts the market the first time (Q116).\00\00\00\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00 The asset fixed at construction.\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b1Keeper only. The strategy claims no Alula farm rewards (Q118), so this records\0anothing; it emits `Harvest` so the trait is the same as for strategies that do.\0a`data` is ignored.\00\00\00\00\00\00\07harvest\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02:Supplies `assets`, pulled from the vault, to the asset's pool of the market named\0aby `data`, and credits the vault with the j-tokens the Market minted. `change` is the\0aposition's value now minus the value last recorded for it. The protocol total grows by\0a`assets`, the principal put in (Q89), less what the position's principal stood above\0aits value (Q90). Refused with `ProtocolRejected` while the pool charges a deposit fee\0a(or it cannot be read): the core vault would book `assets` while the strategy held\0aless, and the vault's other holders would pay the fee (Q117).\00\00\00\00\00\08allocate\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\d5Withdraws `assets` from the market named by `data` and sends them to the vault. An\0aexit a fee would cut is refused with `InsufficientLiquidity` and nothing moves: while\0athe pool charges a flat withdraw fee, and whenever a scarcity fee would apply (Q117).\0aThe core vault's withdraw path calls this whatever `max_deallocate` says, so a fee paid\0ahere would fall on the vault's other holders. While another vault holds part of the\0aobligation, the obligation's whole floor value is refused the same way: the Market\0awould burn every j-token, the other vault's too. Never gated by approval or the\0aprotocol cap. The protocol total loses the principal taken out (Q89), and whatever of\0athe rest stands above the position's value (Q90).\00\00\00\00\00\00\0adeallocate\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\c9Value of every position of `vault`: `floor(j_tokens \c3\97 S / J)` per market from\0a`get_pool`, which reads no oracle; the value last recorded for a market that cannot be\0aread. Never fails and never writes.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0breal_assets\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00-The cap on `total_allocated()`; 0 means none.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cprotocol_cap\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\eeOne instance per asset. `factory` decides which vaults may allocate; `cap_authority`\0aalone sets the protocol cap; `keeper` alone may call `harvest`; only markets\0a`market_manager` deployed are accepted (Q116). All fixed: there is no admin.\00\00\00\00\00\0d__constructor\00\00\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07factory\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dcap_authority\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0emarket_manager\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\015Anyone: lowers `vault`'s principal in `market`, and the protocol total by the same\0aamount, to the position's value when that is lower, and emits `PrincipalSynced`.\0aNever raises it, moves no money and reports no `change`. A position that does not\0aexist, or a market that cannot be read, is left as it is (Q90).\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dsync_position\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06market\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\dfWhat `deallocate(vault, data, x)` can pay in this ledger: the smallest of the\0aposition's value, the pool's cash and, when the pool charges for scarcity, what keeps\0autilization within its limit, the last two after the interest the withdrawal would book\0afirst; and one unit short of the obligation's floor value while another vault holds\0apart of it. 0 while the pool is bad-debt locked or charges a flat withdraw fee, on\0amalformed `data` or on any failed read (Q117). Never writes.\00\00\00\00\0emax_deallocate\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00DSum of the principal every vault has put in and not taken out (Q89).\00\00\00\0ftotal_allocated\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00&Cap authority only. 0 removes the cap.\00\00\00\00\00\10set_protocol_cap\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03cap\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\009What a strategy returns from `allocate` and `deallocate`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00<Signed change of the vault's position value under those IDs.\00\00\00\06change\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00@Risk IDs this move touched; never empty; the first is `id_this`.\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\04\00\00\00`Errors shared by every strategy: 5400\e2\80\935449. 5450\e2\80\935499 are for codes only one strategy needs.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\12\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dNotAuthorized\00\00\00\00\00\15\18\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10VaultNotApproved\00\00\15\19\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dInvalidAmount\00\00\00\00\00\15\1a\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bInvalidData\00\00\00\15\1b\00\00\00/The vault holds less than it asked to take out.\00\00\00\00\14InsufficientPosition\00\00\15\1c\00\00\00\22The protocol cannot pay right now.\00\00\00\00\00\15InsufficientLiquidity\00\00\00\00\00\15\1d\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\13ProtocolCapExceeded\00\00\00\15\1e\00\00\001The protocol refused the call for another reason.\00\00\00\00\00\00\10ProtocolRejected\00\00\15\1f\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cMathOverflow\00\00\15 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eTooManyMarkets\00\00\00\00\15!\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10AssetNotInMarket\00\00\15\22\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dInvalidConfig\00\00\00\00\00\15#\00\00\004The oracle has no live price and the call needs one.\00\00\00\10PriceUnavailable\00\00\15K\00\00\00VAn OTC fill priced further from the oracle than the band allows, against the strategy.\00\00\00\00\00\10PriceOutsideBand\00\00\15L\00\00\00`The position would end outside its leverage or LTV bounds, or the move is not toward\0athe target.\00\00\00\13LeverageOutOfBounds\00\00\00\15M\00\00\00*No such change is waiting on the timelock.\00\00\00\00\00\10ActionNotPending\00\00\15N\00\00\00&The change's timelock has not elapsed.\00\00\00\00\00\12TimelockNotElapsed\00\00\00\00\15O\00\00\00TThe fill's cost away from the oracle price would pass what the band budget has left.\00\00\00\12BandBudgetExceeded\00\00\00\00\15P\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07Harvest\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\07harvest\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0ftotal_allocated\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00|A strategy's protocol cap changed. Published by the registry, and by the strategy itself with\0aits own address as